@startuml dataflow_text_pipeline
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam SequenceArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam SequenceParticipantBorderColor #555555
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBorderColor #999999
skinparam SequenceBoxBorderColor #888888
skinparam SequenceBoxBackgroundColor #F8F8F8

title Luồng dữ liệu: Document Processing Pipeline\n(Presigned Upload -> Parse -> Chunk -> Vector Index)

actor "Giảng viên" as GV
participant "Next.js UI\n(web-bff)" as Web
participant "core-api" as Core
database "PostgreSQL\nSource of Truth" as PG
participant "MinIO\nObject Storage" as MinIO
queue "Redis\nBullMQ + Pub/Sub" as Redis
participant "document-worker" as DocWorker
participant "Parser/OCR\nPDF/DOCX/PPTX" as Parser
participant "Chunker\n+ LO Mapper" as Chunker
participant "Outbox\nPoller" as Outbox
participant "BGE-M3\nEmbedder" as Embedder
database "Qdrant\nlearning_chunks" as Qdrant

== 1. Upload qua presigned URL ==
GV -> Web : Chọn tài liệu
Web -> Core : POST /documents/upload-session\n(course_id, file metadata)
Core -> PG : INSERT documents\n(status=UPLOADING)
Core -> MinIO : Tạo presigned PUT URL\n(bucket: documents)
Core --> Web : {document_id, upload_url}
Web -> MinIO : PUT file trực tiếp
Web -> Core : POST /documents/{id}/confirm-upload
Core -> PG : UPDATE documents\nstatus=UPLOADED
Core -> Redis : publish/job DocumentUploaded
Core --> Web : {status=QUEUED}

== 2. Parse và chunk ==
DocWorker -> Redis : consume DocumentUploaded
DocWorker -> PG : UPDATE status=PARSING\nprogress=...
DocWorker -> MinIO : GET raw file
DocWorker -> Parser : extract_text(file)\nOCR fallback nếu cần
Parser --> DocWorker : ParsedDocument\n{sections, headings, metadata}
DocWorker -> PG : UPDATE status=CHUNKING
DocWorker -> Chunker : chunk(parsed_doc)\nmap chunks -> LO nếu có
Chunker --> DocWorker : chunks[]\n{heading_path, content, lo_refs}

== 3. Giao dịch gốc ==
DocWorker -> PG : BEGIN\nINSERT chunks\nINSERT outbox_events\nCOMMIT
note right of PG
  PostgreSQL giữ dữ liệu gốc.
  Qdrant và Neo4j là derived stores,
  đồng bộ qua Outbox để retry an toàn.
end note

== 4. Lập chỉ mục bất đồng bộ ==
Outbox -> PG : SELECT outbox_events\nWHERE status=PENDING
Outbox -> Redis : enqueue VectorIndexRequested
DocWorker -> Redis : consume VectorIndexRequested
DocWorker -> PG : UPDATE status=EMBEDDING
DocWorker -> Embedder : embed(chunks[].enriched_content)
Embedder --> DocWorker : dense_vectors[1024]
DocWorker -> Qdrant : upsert points\npayload={chunk_id, document_id,\ncourse_id, lo_ids, heading_path,\nsource_type="document"}
DocWorker -> PG : UPDATE status=INDEXED
DocWorker -> Redis : publish TextIndexed

note right of Redis
  TextIndexed chỉ đánh dấu dữ liệu
  đã sẵn sàng cho các pipeline hạ nguồn.
  Micro-content và Quiz Generation
  được mô tả bằng pipeline riêng.
end note

== 5. Silent state progression UI ==
Redis --> Web : BullMQ events / PubSub\nprogress + status
Web --> GV : SSE/WebSocket update\nprogress bar + status=INDEXED

@enduml
